### Demo Stream API Collection for HTTPie

# Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=user@example.com&password=password123

### Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Test Company&email=test@company.com&phone=+1234567890&website=https://test.com

### Create Room
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/room/create
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

videoUrl=https://example.com/video.mp4&videoName=Sample Video

### Join Room
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/room/join
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

roomId=room-abc123

### Create Room with Content
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/room/manage
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

title=Test Room&is_active=true&host_content[]=content1,content2&representative_content[]=content3,content4&representative=rep1,rep2

### Update Room Info
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/room/room-abc123/info
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

title=Updated Room Title&description=Updated description&is_active=true&host_content=content1,content2&representative_content=content3,content4&representative=rep1,rep2

### Request Quote
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/room/room-abc123/quote
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

first_name=John&last_name=Doe&email=john@example.com&phone=+1234567890&company=Test Company&message=Quote request

### Send Email Invitation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/room/send-email
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

name=Recipient Name&receipient=recipient@example.com&url=https://room-url.com&uid=user123

### Upload Content
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/upload/content
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

title=My Video&description=Video description&type=video&library_type=host&file=@/path/to/video.mp4&representative=rep1

### Update Content
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/content-library/content123
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

title=Updated Title&description=Updated description&active=true

### Toggle Content Active Status
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/content-library/content123
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

active=false

### Delete Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/content-library/content123

### Create AI Assistant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai-assistants
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

name=My Assistant&description=AI assistant description&type=chatbot&configuration={"key":"value"}&is_active=true&viewrooom_connections=viewroom1,viewroom2

### Update AI Assistant
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/ai-assistants/assistant123
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

name=Updated Assistant&description=Updated description&type=chatbot&configuration={"updated":"config"}&is_active=true

### Restore AI Assistant
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/ai-assistants/assistant123
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

status=true

### Delete AI Assistant
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/ai-assistants/assistant123

### Remove File from AI Assistant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai-assistants/assistant123/remove-file
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

fileIndex=0

### Upload AI Room Design
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai-room-designer/create
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

title=Room Design&description=Design description&original_file=@/path/to/original.png&generated_file=@/path/to/generated.png

### Get Representatives
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/representatives

### Create Representative
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/representatives
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

name=John Doe&email=john@company.com&phone=+1234567890&is_active=true&schedule=9 AM - 5 PM

### Update Representative
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/representatives
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

id=rep123&name=Updated Name&email=updated@company.com&phone=+1234567890&is_active=true&schedule=9 AM - 5 PM

### Delete Representative
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/representatives
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=rep123

### Create Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/locations
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

name=Main Office&address=123 Main St&city=City&state=State&zip_code=12345&country=Country&phone=+1234567890&Mon=9:00 AM - 5:00 PM&Tue=9:00 AM - 5:00 PM&Wed=9:00 AM - 5:00 PM&Thurs=9:00 AM - 5:00 PM&Fri=9:00 AM - 5:00 PM&Sat=Closed&Sun=Closed&is_active=true

### Update Location
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/locations/location123
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

name=Updated Office&address=456 Updated St&city=Updated City&state=Updated State&zip_code=54321&country=Updated Country&phone=+1234567890&Mon=8:00 AM - 6:00 PM&Tue=8:00 AM - 6:00 PM&Wed=8:00 AM - 6:00 PM&Thurs=8:00 AM - 6:00 PM&Fri=8:00 AM - 6:00 PM&Sat=10:00 AM - 2:00 PM&Sun=Closed&is_active=true

### Delete Location
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/locations/location123

### Delete Video (Superuser Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/room/delete-video
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

videoId=video123 